Package: fuxi-device
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: fuxi port <noreply@localhost>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, initramfs-tools, iw, iproute2, kbd, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: fuxi-firmware, busybox-static, bluez, rmtfs, tqftpserv, qrtr-tools, hexagonrpcd, iio-sensor-proxy, alsa-ucm-conf
Description: Xiaomi 13 (fuxi, SM8550) device support for mainline Linux
 Boot chain tooling and hardware glue for the Xiaomi 13 running mainline
 Linux with the mainline U-Boot + extlinux boot chain:
  - fuxi-kernel-install / fuxi-bootcount: kernel entries under /boot/fuxi,
    extlinux.conf and U-Boot boot-count fallback; hooked into kernel
    postinst/postrm and initramfs post-update
  - fuxi-firmware-devices: start ADSP / IPA / WiFi / Bluetooth once the root
    filesystem (and so /lib/firmware) is available
  - USB network (usb0 10.42.0.2), WiFi regdom, Bluetooth address, panel
    DPMS kick, VT switch
  - sensors (SSC via hexagonrpcd), ALSA UCM profile, power settings override
